  "body": "Discover this beautifully presented brand-new home at 8C Newstead Avenue, Browns Bay. Thoughtfully designed to combine modern style, everyday comfort and practical living.\r\n\r\nFeaturing 5 bedrooms and 3.5 bathrooms, this home offers a spacious and versatile layout, ideal for modern family living.\r\n\r\nThe ground floor features a beautifully designed kitchen flowing seamlessly into the open-plan dining and living area, along with a bedroom complete with its own ensuite. Upstairs, four additional bedrooms provide ample accommodation, with one opening onto a balcony - the perfect spot to relax and enjoy the outlook.\r\n\r\nContemporary design and quality finishes create a stylish, welcoming interior, complemented by abundant natural light throughout. The private backyard provides a peaceful space to unwind, entertain guests and enjoy outdoor living.\r\n\r\nProperty Highlights:\r\n- 5 well-proportioned bedrooms | 3.5 bathrooms\r\n- Open-plan living-dining area with designer kitchen, fully equipped with reliable Fisher & Paykel appliances\r\n- Contemporary finishes throughout for easy, low-maintenance living\r\n- Bright, spacious open-plan kitchen, dining and living area\r\n- Excellent indoor-outdoor flow\r\n- Single internal-access garage\r\n- 10-year Stamford Building Warranty Insurance\r\n\r\nWhether you're looking for a stylish family home or a smart investment in Browns Bay, this property is not to be missed. \r\n\r\nContact Catherine 02102006788 or Barry 0225067888 today for more information or to arrange a viewing.",
